{"id":"f40afef4d16889fd","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-mobius.md","title":"Möbius Function","display":"df-mobius — Möbius Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mobius","aliases":["58-df-mobius","Möbius Function"],"display":"df-mobius — Möbius Function","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mobius"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mobius</span><span>Möbius Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mobius — Möbius Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}\">\\(\\mu:\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}\\)</span> (Möbius function defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mobius} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mu(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n=1,\\\\(-1)^k,&amp;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists(p_1,\\ldots,p_k)\\in\\omega^k\\;\\left(n=\\prod_{i=1}^kp_i\\land\\forall i\\leq k\\;\\mathrm{Prime}(p_i)\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\leq k\\;(p_i\\neq p_j)\\right),\\\\0,&amp;\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land p^2\\mid n).\\end{cases}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mobius} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mu(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n=1,\\\\(-1)^k,&amp;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists(p_1,\\ldots,p_k)\\in\\omega^k\\;\\left(n=\\prod_{i=1}^kp_i\\land\\forall i\\leq k\\;\\mathrm{Prime}(p_i)\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\leq k\\;(p_i\\neq p_j)\\right),\\\\0,&amp;\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land p^2\\mid n).\\end{cases}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Möbius: encodes inclusion-exclusion; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu * 1 = \\epsilon\">\\(\\mu * 1 = \\epsilon\\)</span> (Dirichlet convolution)</li>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{d\\mid n}\\mu(d)=\\epsilon(n)\">\\(\\sum_{d\\mid n}\\mu(d)=\\epsilon(n)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu^2\">\\(\\mu^2\\)</span>: characteristic of squarefree numbers; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{d^2|n} \\mu(d) = \\mu^2(n)\">\\(\\sum_{d^2|n} \\mu(d) = \\mu^2(n)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Mertens: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n \\leq N} \\mu(n)/n \\to 0\">\\(\\sum_{n \\leq N} \\mu(n)/n \\to 0\\)</span> as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N \\to \\infty\">\\(N \\to \\infty\\)</span> (equivalent to PNT)</li>\n<li>Mertens conjecture: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\sum_{n \\leq N} \\mu(n)| &lt; \\sqrt{N}\">\\(|\\sum_{n \\leq N} \\mu(n)| &lt; \\sqrt{N}\\)</span> was false (found 1985)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Apostol, Introduction to Analytic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Hardy and Wright, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu:\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mobius} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mu(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&n=1,\\\\(-1)^k,&\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists(p_1,\\ldots,p_k)\\in\\omega^k\\;\\left(n=\\prod_{i=1}^kp_i\\land\\forall i\\leq k\\;\\mathrm{Prime}(p_i)\\land\\forall i<j\\leq k\\;(p_i\\neq p_j)\\right),\\\\0,&\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land p^2\\mid n).\\end{cases}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu * 1 = \\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{d\\mid n}\\mu(d)=\\epsilon(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{d^2|n} \\mu(d) = \\mu^2(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{n \\leq N} \\mu(n)/n \\to 0","display":false},{"tex":"N \\to \\infty","display":false},{"tex":"|\\sum_{n \\leq N} \\mu(n)| < \\sqrt{N}","display":false}],"bytes":1354,"backlinks":[{"id":"804e9900d6a09ca9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu:\\mathbb N_{>0}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}$ (Möbius function, see [[../batch08/58-df-mobius.md]])"},{"id":"055b3e50c22c8235","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu:\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-mobius.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-851","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-mobius.md|58-df-mobius]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["dad686059f3ca152"]}